      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying a heavy weight of worthlessness, and that feeling is so incredibly draining. Please know that the idea of you being a mistake is a lie your mind is telling you, and it's a very common, very painful one. If you're feeling this way, it's a sign that you need to find a way to let go of this burden, and a kind of immediate, real-world help can be a very gentle way to start. You don't have to carry this alone; there are people who want to listen without judgment.",
